{"title":"Production Manager (Food) Roadmap","role":"Production Manager (Food)","summary":"A Production Manager (Food) plans, supervises and continuously improves food-manufacturing operations to ensure that products are produced safely, consistently, efficiently and according to quality and regulatory requirements. The role combines food technology, production planning, food safety, quality systems, process engineering, supply-chain coordination, people management and cost control.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Food Technology"},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Direct alignment. Food Technology is one of the strongest undergraduate routes into food production and manufacturing management."}],"intro":[{"type":"table","header":["Item","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Starts"},{"text":"Year 1 UG · 2026"}],[{"text":"Current degree"},{"text":"B.Tech / B.E. Food Technology"}],[{"text":"Desired career"},{"text":"Production Manager (Food)"}],[{"text":"Career cluster"},{"text":"Engineering & Technology"}],[{"text":"Primary route"},{"text":"Food Technology → Production/Operations → Production Manager"}],[{"text":"Core domains"},{"text":"Food processing, production planning, food safety, quality, process optimisation, plant operations"}],[{"text":"Major industries"},{"text":"Dairy, beverages, bakery, packaged foods, meat/seafood, snacks, frozen foods, ingredients, nutraceuticals"}]]}],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Food-processing fundamentals, plant exposure, quality/safety skills and production projects"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Production supervision, food safety, process optimisation, lean manufacturing and operations"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Production Manager, Operations Manager, Plant Manager or Manufacturing Excellence specialist"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Lead smart-food manufacturing using automation, analytics, AI, traceability and sustainable production"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These are career-planning horizons rather than guaranteed promotion timelines."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Mathematics, chemistry, biology, physics and computing"},{"text":"University + NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Technical calculations and Excel/Python exercises"},{"text":"Scientific foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Food chemistry, microbiology and nutrition fundamentals"},{"text":"Food Technology coursework"},{"text":"Food-analysis and microbiology reports"},{"text":"Food-science foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Food processing, preservation and unit operations"},{"text":"Core courses + laboratory"},{"text":"Processing experiment portfolio"},{"text":"Processing capability"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Food engineering, heat/mass transfer and equipment"},{"text":"Food-engineering courses"},{"text":"Equipment/process calculations"},{"text":"Engineering capability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Industrial food production and plant operations"},{"text":"Industry case studies"},{"text":"Production-flow analysis"},{"text":"Manufacturing understanding"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Food safety, HACCP, quality and production planning"},{"text":"Food-safety training + plant exposure"},{"text":"HACCP plan + quality project"},{"text":"Compliance capability"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Lean manufacturing, supply chain, ERP, costing and automation"},{"text":"Advanced coursework + industry"},{"text":"Production optimisation project"},{"text":"Management readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"I